Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn on my temperature\Nregulation feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.12,0:01:00.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right top),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\3c&H371710&\pos(471,76)\t(276,277,\c&H67423D&\3c&HF8F0F4&)\t(651,652,\3c&H371710&\c&HF9F0F3&)}Keep Warm
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.12,0:01:00.62,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\fs9\3c&H371710&\t(651,652,\c&H67423D&\3c&HF8F0F4&)\pos(473,133)}Keep Cold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, things just cool\Ndown a lot. Thanks, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, fair Lamas, I want some cool too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cold is just what the Boxxo\Nordered. Yeah, right? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wear that cloak Boxo got\Nme in the dark forest stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that she should need to use\Nanother heat countermeasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Llamas is being nice and making it\Na point to wear the cloak I gave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxxo, how do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ad or a bo-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pays to compliment her when\Nshe responds so, well, adorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's no time for\Nsoothing our discomfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to go to the Hunters Association\Nand deliver the letter from Director Bear.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.08,0:01:43.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\NBut inside I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.16,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders I travel to and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.30,0:01:56.26,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fro on the back of my\Nsuper strong partner Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a dream of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you. I'll\Nbe able to splash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream. It's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.09,0:03:16.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,450)\fscx70\pos(455.2,52.4)}Into the Scorching Desert
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here from the\NClearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a letter from the director there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'd like to deliver it to\NDirector Scorching if we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word, Master Boxo, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sincerest apologies if I worried you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did sort of forget\Nabout him, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, now I've caught up\Nwith everyone who got scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got sent to this place by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and as I was pondering how\NI had no way to get back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up helping defend the village\Nwhen a swarm of monsters attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everyone else is safe\Nback in the Clear Flow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm relieved to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we ran into Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he's been faring\Non his own in this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping his communication\Nissues have improved a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a relief you're here, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the stress and tension these past\Nfew days have really wrecked my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrecked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It did nothing for your looks, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there's no way you were\Ngoing to improve that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The director says he will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although this stratum has had\Nits own fair share of weirdness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what with the monster swarm\Nattacking the village and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we fought them all off, caught what\Nappeared to be their commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and threw their butts in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, we have a letter here\Nfor you from Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you guys have\Nhad it pretty rough as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can provide us with water? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be a big help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This heat has the Oasis low on\Nwater and things are looking bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I ask for it right away? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I started doing business on\Nthis stratum with its horrible heat,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.49,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(195,20)\fad(500,1)\3c&HDAFF9B&}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cold drinks have been flying\Noff the proverbial shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been selling with no breaks from dawn\Ntill dusk every day without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Busy day, huh, Boxo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoei's gone off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you maybe want to go check out the magic\Nitem shop that was selling those boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some sightseeing at night could be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of magic item this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that one allows you to\Nclean your bath water
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and store it in a bucket\Nso you can use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Llamas is\Ngoing to do some shopping
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before hitting up the\Nmerchant for information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that would really come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to buy it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you for your business, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've really been in luck lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the third new customer\Nwho's coming today alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would the others be a man\Ndressed like a clergyman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a short-haired woman\Nwith a bow on her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, yes, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know them, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the clergyman had questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He asked where I'd gotten some boots\NI sold recently, then he left, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That information is confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was heavy, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, but would you mind telling me\Nwhich hunter sold you those boots, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I have to\Nthink of my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like disclosure of personal info\Nis problematic even in this other world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case... Letter! Uh, what? Letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got letters of introduction from the\Ndirector here and one from Suori, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's from Director\NScorching and what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One from that giant corporation, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori's letter had an even bigger\Neffect than Director Scorching's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori calling herself\Nthe daughter of a big
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-time merchant might be an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make an exception\Nand tell you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no surviving in this business\Nif you cross those two, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The salesman is scared out of her wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very curious to know\Nwhat was in that letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who sold the\Nboots to me was Tashtay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hunter who's pretty\Nactive on the stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, why couldn't you have invited me to\Njoin you on your evening stroll tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I dine alone, women always end up\Napproaching me and it stresses me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fun thing about Mishuel\Nis that he's being sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am being sarcastic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, I asked Director\NScorching about this hunter called Tashtay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he's the leader of a hunter\Nteam known as the Billowing Flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They number around a dozen in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told they're\Ncurrently exploring some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruins in a desert region of this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.84,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish to parlay with this Tashtay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it seems your only option\Nis to make for the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But going there would mean having to\Ncross that awful desert, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master Boxo, would you mind\Nterribly if I accompanied you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish he wouldn't look at\Nme like an abandoned puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to handle this skillfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's for you, Apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo called me his apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything, you name it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to disappear again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to deal\Nwith this all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have our issues, but\Nwe're all on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply don't wish to\Ninconvenience everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go, deciding on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without even discussing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Captain Carry Oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're doing what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just not trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if he had been honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe these could have turned out\Ndifferently and we'd all be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you all came here\Nin search of me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am deeply sorry to have\Ncaused you such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you've caused trouble,\Nthen I want you to talk it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You leaving without saying\Nanything is what made us worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you'll like this story, but\Nare you willing to hear it? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened back before I\Njoined the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A childhood friend and I\Nwere working as hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew each other well and\Nmade an incredible team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People were lauding us as\Nthe next up-and-coming duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Heavy had a partner before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after a series of lucky breaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I received a surprisingly\Nhefty reward and I decided to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get my friend some new boots\Nfor her upcoming birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those boots were the untiring God's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boots I won were the\Nsame ones you gave her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She, my friend, was pleased with them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wore those boots everywhere\Nshe went without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She would always say she'd never\Ngive them up no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she said it with a smile every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy's expression speaks volumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question how\Nimportant his friend was to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not long after,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were attacked by bandits while\Non assignment escorting a merchant,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a blow from an adversary\Nleft me unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I came to, I was greeted by the\Nhorrible sight of corpses all around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:10:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There before my eyes were my friend's\Nremains, her legs cut off at the knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hewn off crudely, cruelly. With\Nan axe or other rough blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart broke She had tied them\Ntoo tightly because they meant
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so much to her And the bandits\Ncouldn't get them off of her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wore masks so I\Ndon't know their faces
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only clue was that\Npair of boots they stole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clinging to hope I became\Nobsessed with footwear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Single-minded in my\Nquest for vengeance. That
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brings us to now I never\Nexpected Heavy to have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a tragic hero past\NI may be a clergyman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my heart has been full of\Nnaught but revenge ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic when you\Nconsider the judgment I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doled out to Captain\NKerioyl and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both you and the captain,\Nyou're total dumbasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had talked about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might have found the boots and\Nthe people who sold them much sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had shared your own sad story,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might have been willing to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their family problems and\Nwe'd still be together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but this is my personal\Nbusiness - Don't you Hevee me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see things turned out this way\Nbecause everyone's so full of secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of the lies and deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want help, all you have to do is\Nexplain the situation and ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's too much or I don't\Nwant to do it, I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what you're doing is wrong, as a\Ncomrade, I'll do all I can to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I wish you'd stop deciding and be a\Nburden or that you already know my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fear made everything much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, might I request your assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At your service. Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.95,0:12:01.95,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(496,184)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first obstacle is finding a\Nway through the scorching desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The environment is so harsh that even\Nwalking through it will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that magic\Nitem shop has anything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could maybe help\Nus deal with the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get here, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had time to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to come along, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to be okay in this heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a snow fairy, but I'm not\Ngoing to melt if it gets too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can cool down\Nthe air if I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the temperature problem,\NI have a solution for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magic item has the effect of\Nblocking heat and cooling nearby moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll turn any sweat and\Nhumidity into a refreshing mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that item, I bet we'd be able\Nto cross the desert with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, these are for Llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from the Dark\NForest Stratum Weapons Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they can\Nsomehow change their weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those will make her attacks\Nway stronger and help
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her maintain control when\Nshe's going full tilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm not as worried anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have caused\Nquite the kerfuffle. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I never\Nplanned on telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose I ought to think, Shui...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't have been easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least now he's able to unload some\Nof the burdens he's had to carry alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not naive enough to\Nthink that everything
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be resolved during this one outing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but maybe I'll find a stopping point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as hot as we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, even hotter, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we're wearing the\Ncloaks Hulemy made for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems to be tough going for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll scratch that, not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little farther, guys,\Nthen we'll take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas and Botan are doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my temperature regulation\Npowers, Llamas isn't sweating at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Botan seems dandy with all\Nthe cold air Kiko is providing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could be my boyfriend for\Njust this stratum, that'd be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd even say for being best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo is looking more and more attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you could just\Nhave me at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, master, I'd do anything you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I look close, his\Nbody is like a pair of boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you three talk,\Nthe less sense you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to Master Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the heat to\Nbe too much for the clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like they were useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I took mine off, it was so hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to\Nshrivel up and die right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some sort of calendar\Nthey use in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:14:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those numbers are dates, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we had a moment, I\Nwanted to check today's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one of the dates is circled in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It marks a certain anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't pry into her private affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa that's the desert pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep the desert pillar is supposed to\Nbe huge so it's likely still far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert pillar is apparently another\Nname for the ruins of an old tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said to be a hundred\Nstories tall and the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stratum lord can be found\Non the very top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His black feathers look striking\Nagainst the cloudless sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait what? Kuroyata!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say you saw him disappear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know I wasn't just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure this was the spot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, something seems\Nkind of weird here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Lammis. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tower's really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right there in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed the\Ndesert pillar would be this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's some kind of illusion\Nmagic at work, similar to my blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense, Kuroyata disappeared\Nafter flying past that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which was making us misjudge the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm betting this trick was set up on purpose,\Nto keep anyone from getting too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroyata!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said there were a bunch of\Nwhat seemed to be lookouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they went inside to get\Narrows when they spotted him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this would be a good time to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to pass up this\Nchance that Kuroyata set up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's enormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they reacting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like they're\Nwaiting for instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the commander here\Nhas already been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense it lines\Nup with what director
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scorching told us maybe\Nthe commander is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make us lower our\Nguard while they build up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their forces and make plans\Nto attack the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would certainly\Nexplain this situation wait
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sec i just thought of a\Nway to turn this around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On him, here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.69,0:17:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plan's working heavy's using his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illusions to make These monsters\Nthink that their buddies are us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take this new\Ngear out on a test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start by getting heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was surprisingly effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Field will be able\Nto save up quite a bit of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got to deal with any\Nambushes or traps waiting ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, do you think you could go in front?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your barrier is probably\Ngoing to come in handy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there with you. Hey, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to interrupt\Nwhile you're making plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you think I could have seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've still got a back-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, be ready for anything\Nfrom this point forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you can come up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that if whoever set\Nthese traps knew what we were doing to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'd be pretty mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it were me, I don't\Nknow if I could handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears there are enemies\Nwaiting beyond the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas, go ahead and\Nbust it wide open. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock, knock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they were\Nlurking behind the door
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they could pounce on\Nus the second it opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.38,0:19:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They definitely weren't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be the Billowing Flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you guys\Nthink you are? That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He matches the description\Nwe were given for Tashtay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a group of hunters who came\Nhere from the Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're from another stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must know, the reason we came is to\Ndiscuss some important business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we received more of a\Nwelcome than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to talk business?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to tell us how\Nthe hell you found out that we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were hiding monsters in here\Nso we could attack the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, that was\Ntheir plan all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I'd appreciate it if you\Ncleared something up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your group has been conspiring\Nwith the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason why you've been able
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control the monsters\Non the first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that just about sum everything up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you already know that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I suppose there's no\Npoint in trying to play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's only temporary, but\Nwe're working with the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are you on the Demon Lord's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only hurting innocent people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could spare me all\Nthat goody-two-shoes talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing it for money, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a no-brainer when we're getting enough\Nmoney that we never have to work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the way you're talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it sounds as if you're quite comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with doing illegal\Nthings for personal gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robberies, rapes, and even murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:20:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all blends together after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect from a former bandit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing that feels\Nbetter than trampling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over a weakling while they beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are total scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, do\Nyou recognize these boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.14,0:21:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't those the boots we sold\Nfor a pretty penny a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stole them off of that hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chick was going on about\Nhow she'd never hand them over
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what because she got\Nthem from someone dear to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was pissing me off, so\NI cut off her freaking legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I get to achieve my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prayed for this moment countless\Ntimes, and now it's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\NI've longed to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may beg me for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may cry from the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may even attempt to repent,\Nbut none of it will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This memory is the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.34,0:23:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to move on\Nto the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This memory is the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave you\Nwith the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs17.4\pos(433.2,296.8)\fsp.3}Blizzard in the Desert
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

